Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get chapter details — replace with a real chapter ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapter/get/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get chapters belonging to course 7
GET {{baseUrl}}/7/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get lessons in a chapter — replace with a real chapter ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapter/13/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get lesson details — replace with a real lesson ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/lesson/get/LESSON_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get materials for a lesson — replace with a real lesson ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/lesson/LESSON_ID/materials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get one material — replace with a real material ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/material/get/MATERIAL_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


